# Types and models

Give every value a named type. Keep each model in its own file, grouped with the feature it belongs to.

- A feature lives in one folder.
- The model, the screen, and the functions for that feature are separate files in that folder.
- Import a shared model instead of redefining its fields.
- Request and response types stay distinct from the domain model.

```text
checklist/
  item.tsx        ChecklistItem and how one item is shown
  checklist.tsx   the list
  functions.ts    add, update, complete, remove
```
